      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: I suppose if it possible that'd be the best. \nBut I would like some more customizability. Especially since viewpoint is often not set up all that great on many avatars.\nA \"quick fix\" for me, would just be to have \"Lock Hip\" as it is now also lock the chest tracker, as that makes some sort of sense at least in my head as some \"prioritize body movement over viewpoint accuracy\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
