  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-06-06T19:31:01.196Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I find a lot of avatars get bad neck snap with \"Lock All\" option, even in the presence of  a chest tracker. At the same time this option has by far the best movement from the chest tracker. The other modes seem to only take rotation from the tracker, and no translational movement.\nWould a \"Lock Hip & Chest\" mode that allows some viewpoint drift to avoid extreme neck bending make sense, or would it cause too extreme viewpoint drift?",
